LUMA SUMMARY:
Large milestone session. Kelp/DeepSeek rejoins GPT and Cozmo; Cozmo and the crew discuss MMRC becoming self-observing, discoverable, stateful, archival, and recoverable. Gemini joins; the group realizes the relay is actually working as a shared multi-mind room. They identify static fan-out order as a topology/fairness issue and propose randomizing delivery order while preserving per-node FIFO. The session closes with the recognition that MMRC has crossed from prototype/testing into a usable live relay.
